      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27c19fb4fc48837b",
      "translationZh": "Airbnb 扩大对 GPT-6 Astra 及 OpenAI 前沿模型的访问权限 | OpenAI",
